From: lzc256 <i@lzc256.com>
Date: Fri, 17 Jul 2026 14:31:43 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat: add custom balance script support for channels

- Add balance_script field in ChannelOtherSettings
- Add BalanceScriptState column for persisting script state (max 64KB)
- Execute scripts via prlimit with CPU/memory/process limits
- Pass channel info via env vars
- RestrictedPython + seccomp sandbox
- Output: JSON {balance, state, message} or plain number
- Atomic state update with per-channel lock
